WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  components/ai/AIFeedbackQueueTriage.tsx → components/ai/AIFeatureCard.tsx →
  components/ai/AiOutputPanel.tsx + components/ai/AIThinkingIndicator.tsx. The Helix feedback-triage advisor
  rendered beneath the Admin FeedbackQueuePage per-row manual controls:

    Gate (withAiFeature('feedback-queue-triage', InnerSection), ADR-015): renders nothing unless
      useAiEnabled('feedback-queue-triage') is on (ai_mode local/cloud AND the per-feature toggle on). In off
      mode NO data-ai-feature marker enters the DOM.
    InnerSection({feedbackId}):
      haveFeedback = typeof id==='number' && Number.isFinite(id) && id>0
      body = useMemo → { feedback_id: haveFeedback ? feedbackId : 0 }
      stream = useAiStream({ url:'/ai/feedback/triage/draft', body, onEvent: ()=>{} })
      → <AIFeatureCard title='Helix triage advisor' description=<privacy paragraph> buttonLabel='Suggest triage'
                       badgeLabel='Helix' canStart={haveFeedback} stream={stream} />
    AIFeatureCard: GlassPanel → header(title + Helix AIBadge + description + emptyHint when !canStart) →
      "Ask Helix" Button (idle 'Ask Helix' / streaming 'Helix is thinking…' AIThinkingDots; disabled =
      `!canStart || isStreaming` — a COMPUTED expression; aria-label "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}"; title=description)
      → AiOutputPanel(text, state, error).
    AiOutputPanel branch precedence (reproduced exactly): hasAnything = text>0 || state∈{streaming,error,done};
      !hasAnything → render nothing; state==='error' → "Helix error: {error ?? unknown}"; text===''&&streaming →
      AIThinkingIndicator (shimmer lines + bouncing dots); else → the accumulated delta text (pre-wrap).
  Data sources (prompt): useUpdateFeedback / useTranslation / useAiStream.
    • useTranslation → the P1/S10 i18n facade (AIFeedbackTriageStrings).
    • useAiStream    → the P1/S8 stream seam (AIFeedbackTriageSource.suggestTriage/cancel + the stream snapshot).
    • useUpdateFeedback → PROPOSE-ONLY contract: the web InnerSection NEVER calls it (the advisor only proposes;
      the operator's manual controls remain the sole write authority). Reproduced verbatim — the native surface
      exposes no feedback-mutation affordance and never writes. Asserted by testProposeOnlyNeverWritesFeedback.

