DISCLOSED FAITHFUL DEVIATIONS  (no silent drift)
  • paused-confirm NOT modeled: AiStreamState's 'paused-confirm' is unreachable for this surface (the triage draft
    endpoint emits only delta/done/error; onEvent is a no-op; AiOutputPanel itself has no confirm branch). Modeling
    it would invent UI the web never shows. The four reachable phases (idle/streaming/done/error) are reproduced.
  • emptyHint surfaced: the web parent passes no emptyHint, but AIFeatureCard documents this exact "Waiting for a
    feedback row…" hint for the no-row case, and the native state contract requires a friendly empty state (never a
    blank box). Shown only when !canStart — a supported, prompt-mandated leaf, not a behavior change.
  • button placement 'below': AIFeatureCard supports inline/below; the long privacy paragraph + the P4 leaf
    freshness chrome make the right-aligned 'below' row the HIG-idiomatic choice. Same affordances, computed disable.
  • loading/error/stale/offline are P4 leaf states layered around the genuine web surface (the web AIFeedbackQueue-
    Triage has only the gate + stream states), consistent with the established P4 leaf contract (cf. 0237 AiUsageCard).

STATES (every non-gated one renders — no hidden surface)
  gated    → withAiFeature off → the whole surface is withdrawn (EmptyView), reproducing ADR-015. NOT a hidden
             section: when the feature is on, the body renders.
  loading  → enablement settings still resolving → skeleton chrome (P4 leaf).
  empty    → ready & no row selected (!canStart) → the "Waiting for a feedback row…" hint + disabled action +
             absent output panel; the card still shows title/badge/summary → never a blank box.
  error    → settings snapshot failed → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf). (Stream errors render in the output
             panel as the inline "Helix error: …" line — the web AiOutputPanel branch.)
  ready    → summary + the action + the streaming output panel (idle-hidden / thinking / prose / error).
  stale / offline → header chip + banner; one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition; offline shows the
             last-known state with no auto-refresh.

